{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他刚经历一段幸福的亲近，却开始害怕失去，担心对方以后不再需要自己，想把露出的喜欢藏回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福后的不安、贪恋、害怕失去、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"他明知道没人能保证永远；起初是怕给对方添负担；而真正想把喜欢藏回去时，自己反而更难受。这几层需要读完几段长句才能完整串起来。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他在幸福之后越来越害怕失去这份亲近，想收回自己的喜欢，却又舍不得真的退回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、患得患失、心疼、矛盾、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"他想听到不会改变的承诺，却知道没人能答应永远；以及他已经无法再装作不在乎，真心对待对方也是自己的真实愿望。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他意识到自己越来越在乎对方，害怕有一天不再被需要，想保护自己，却又不愿意放弃这份真心。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"幸福掺着悲伤、害怕失去、纠结、心软、舍不得\",\n      \"missed\": \"最后一段真正重要的反转：他不是不想藏起喜欢，而是发现藏回去会让自己更难受；另外‘脚下踩得很稳’和‘确认刚才的灿烂’需要进一步阅读才能找到与人物处境的联系。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三段同等醒目的长句同时承担主要叙事，第一眼能抓到害怕失去的大方向，但不容易迅速分辨哪一段才是此刻最核心的变化。两组短语数量较多，且‘终于说出口’‘后面又有大浪’‘脚下踩得很稳’等缺少明确的情境挂点，容易被扫成独立的情绪词。人物的处境、感受和最后的矛盾实际上能够连起来，但需要在三段长句之间来回扫读，才能完整理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "888c0015-42f8-4bc7-9049-646f8ebb21b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003349404129Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:34:37.676063+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b88b235048af8dd0bb35583e513528bf2f9f75ef0fd707ae71d1a3340d154fe9", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003349404129Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "34c7b0ba875b22f6456f6be220954b81e85851e0e8a194d1312cd2daea2ee860"}}}
